  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: badcc343379a2484387c7e828270c449, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_EN 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dial
  scripts:
  - talker: customer
    text: Hello. You have quite a lot of unusual items here.
  - talker: customer
    text: "Especially that pocket watch over there\u2014it's extremely rare...\nIt
      looks a lot like one I used to own a long time ago."
  - talker: customer
    text: Oh, I actually came here to sell something.
  - talker: customer
    text: 'It''s this box. I don''t know how old it is,

      but I paid a fortune
      for it at an auction.'
  - talker: customer
    text: 'I haven''t opened it myself, so I don''t know what''s inside.

      Judging
      by how heavy it is, there''s definitely something in there.'
  - talker: customer
    text: 'You see the inscription carved here on the box? It says, "Do not open
      this box."

      Someone might have just scribbled it on as a prank, but...
      it just gives me the creeps.'
  - talker: customer
    text: So, would you like to buy it?
  - talker: 
    text: (It looks quite valuable.)
  - talker: 
    text: Yes, I'll take it.
  - talker: customer
    text: Thanks for buying it. I'll stop by again sometime to browse.
  - talker: 
    text: (Should I open the box?)
